UnitCLPool::SwapBase
├── when amountSpecified eq zero
│   └── it reverts with AS
└── when amountSpecified doesn't eq zero
    ├── when pool is locked
    │   └── it reverts with LOK
    └── when pool is unlocked
        ├── when swap is zeroForOne
        │   └── when sqrtPriceLimit geq current sqrtPrice or leq MIN_SQRT_RATIO
        │       └── it reverts with SPL
        └── when swap is oneForZero
            └── when sqrtPriceLimit leq current sqrtPrice or geq MAX_SQRT_RATIO
                └── it reverts with SPL
